sequenceDiagram
    participant User as Data Scientist<br/>(Python code)
    participant SDK as CodeFlare SDK<br/>(Codeflare facade)
    participant AuthKit as kube-authkit<br/>Auth Provider
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant KubeRay as KubeRay Operator
    participant Kueue as Kueue Controller
    participant FS as Local Filesystem<br/>~/.local/share/codeflare/tls/
    participant RayDash as Ray Dashboard<br/>8265/TCP HTTPS mTLS

    Note over User,RayDash: Flow 1: Ray Cluster Lifecycle

    User->>SDK: Codeflare(auth_config=..., namespace=...)
    SDK->>AuthKit: Authenticate (OIDC / OAuth / kubeconfig)
    AuthKit-->>SDK: Kubernetes ApiClient

    User->>SDK: cf.clusters.create(ClusterConfiguration)
    SDK->>K8sAPI: GET kueue.x-k8s.io LocalQueues<br/>Auth: Bearer/OIDC
    K8sAPI-->>SDK: Default LocalQueue resolved
    SDK->>K8sAPI: GET datasciencecluster.opendatahub.io<br/>Auth: Bearer/OIDC
    K8sAPI-->>SDK: RHOAI-managed Kueue status

    SDK->>K8sAPI: APPLY ray.io/v1 RayCluster CR<br/>Auth: Bearer/OIDC
    K8sAPI-->>KubeRay: Watch event
    KubeRay-->>K8sAPI: Create pods, services, CA secret

    SDK->>K8sAPI: GET Secret {cluster}-ca-secret-*<br/>(poll until available)
    K8sAPI-->>SDK: CA certificate + key

    SDK->>SDK: Generate TLS client cert<br/>RSA-3072, SHA-256
    SDK->>FS: Write certs (mode 0600)<br/>ca.crt, tls.crt, tls.key

    Note over SDK,RayDash: Dashboard URL Discovery (fallback chain)
    SDK->>K8sAPI: GET gateway.networking.k8s.io HTTPRoute
    alt HTTPRoute found (RHOAI v3.0+)
        K8sAPI-->>SDK: HTTPRoute with dashboard URL
    else Fallback to OpenShift Route
        SDK->>K8sAPI: GET route.openshift.io Route
        K8sAPI-->>SDK: Route hostname
    else Fallback to GatewayConfig
        SDK->>K8sAPI: GET services.platform.opendatahub.io GatewayConfig
        K8sAPI-->>SDK: Gateway hostname
    end

    SDK->>RayDash: Connect (mTLS certs)<br/>Auth: Bearer token (OpenShift)
    RayDash-->>SDK: Connection established

    User->>SDK: cf.clusters.status()
    SDK->>K8sAPI: GET RayCluster status
    K8sAPI-->>SDK: Cluster status

    Note over User,RayDash: Flow 2: RayJob Submission

    User->>SDK: cf.jobs.submit(ClusterConfiguration, entrypoint=...)
    SDK->>K8sAPI: CREATE ray.io/v1 RayJob CR<br/>Auth: Bearer/OIDC
    K8sAPI-->>KubeRay: Watch event
    KubeRay-->>K8sAPI: Create ephemeral RayCluster + submit job

    loop Poll until complete
        SDK->>K8sAPI: GET RayJob status<br/>Auth: Bearer/OIDC
        K8sAPI-->>SDK: Job status (PENDING/RUNNING/SUCCEEDED/FAILED)
    end

    SDK-->>User: Job result
